      <description sparkle:format="markdown">## 更新内容

- 修复连续拖动进度条时，播放位置可能跳回上一次拖动目标的问题。跳转完成后，进度条会立即显示实际落点。
- 改善 H.264 MP4 视频从中途开始播放或跳转时的定位，减少跳到错误画面的问题。

需要 macOS 12.0 或更高版本。

## What’s New

- Fixed an issue where rapidly scrubbing could send the playhead back to an earlier seek target. The progress bar now shows the actual playback position as soon as the seek finishes.
- Improved playback from a saved position and seeking in H.264 MP4 videos, reducing jumps to the wrong frame.

Requires macOS 12.0 or later.
</description>
